      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Near Place du Pin and the harbour district, Babbo Mio serves Italian cuisine in one of Nice's lively neighbourhoods.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The official Nice Côte d'Azur tourist office listing confirms that dogs are accepted provided they're kept on a leash. A specialised travelling-with-a-dog website also recommends the address in a tour of the Garibaldi / Place du Pin area.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the neighbourhood has several other dog-friendly addresses just a few metres away, a good option if you want to compare on the spot.</div>

